                                                "sense_id": "47bdb384-d1af-3e9a-9cce-028f332de072",
                                                "text": "I opened it with apathy; the theory which he attempts to demonstrate and the wonderful facts which he relates soon changed this feeling into enthusiasm."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
